Author: Dr. Thorsten Tepper Garcia

Date: 13 MAY 2020

About:

This subdirectory contains a number of patches
to files originally in pm.

init_sink.f90:
- added kpc2cm, km2cm conversion factors
- added scale_m
- scaled ic_sink input values to code units
- added input value 'sid' to last column
- changed slevel to levelmin in lines 258-9
- swapped lines 261 and 262:
		103  continue
     	 sinkint_level=levelmin
	to:
     	 sinkint_level=levelmin
		103  continue

	as otherwise sinkint_level remains uninitialised.
- moved output sink properties to screen to end of subroutine
- added direct force scheme information to output to screen
	